          Rivervale, home of the halflings, this is the place of the greatest evil in the world, so all of you evil.... err good alligned characters can get the satisfaction that YOU wiped evil from Norrath.  EVERYONE is invited.  Our goal is to kill the deputy and mayor.  Rivervale has the layout of the easiest town to raid, so you wont be fighting 4 GMs at one time.  COME destroy these happy good....  Err EVIL little devils!!!!  This is also a contest.  A prize of 20kpp will be given to the person who I think does their best to destroy them.  Second prize of 10kpp, third 5kpp, fourth 1kpp.  AND to the guild who helps the most the guild leader shall be presented with 30kpp  and an ABITOR'S COMBINE GREATSWORD!!!  Which is 30 dmg, 43 dly, 15 wisdom, 25 mana, usable by classes that can use 2hs weapons.  And of course if your group does most dmg you get looting rights, though the prize will be worth more and wont go to a full group of wizzies.<br>
          <br>
          Why am I spending all of this money for this?  Me and my friendscame from Fennin Ro, where once and a while there would be a town raid and it would be great fun.  When we moved to Luclin we were disappointed still nobody has tried to raid a town, so the 5 of us got this money and sword to give out in Luclin's FIRST TOWN RAID!!!<br>

